  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Whole long-legged long-necked waterbird with broad duck-like bill; not isolated skull or fossil slab. [\"AMNH28505 is a multi-individual disarticulated assemblage, not a single measured complete skeleton.\", \"Presbyornis sp.90mm skull is a distinct specimen and genus-level evidence only.\", \"Feather pattern, color, pose, neck soft contour and model head length are reconstructions.\", \"Use modern anseriform classification, not1980paper broader evolutionary claims.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"estimated_standing_height_m\": 1.0, \"height_provenance\": \"AMNH species educational estimate, not one measured articulated individual.\", \"reference_genus_skull_m\": 0.09, \"skull_provenance\": \"Smithsonian Fig8/9 Presbyornis sp. specimen, separate genus-level comparison; not assigned to AMNH28505 or exact P.pervetus model.\", \"model_head_bill_length_m\": 0.1, \"model_head_status\": \"Reconstruction choice near genus evidence; soft tissue and species uncertainty.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Whole long-legged long-necked waterbird with broad duck-like bill; not isolated skull or fossil slab. [\"AMNH28505 is a multi-individual disarticulated assemblage, not a single measured complete skeleton.\", \"Presbyornis sp.90mm skull is a distinct specimen and genus-level evidence only.\", \"Feather pattern, color, pose, neck soft contour and model head length are reconstructions.\", \"Use modern anseriform classification, not1980paper broader evolutionary claims.\"] {\"unit\": \"meter\", \"estimated_standing_height_m\": 1.0, \"height_provenance\": \"AMNH species educational estimate, not one measured articulated individual.\", \"reference_genus_skull_m\": 0.09, \"skull_provenance\": \"Smithsonian Fig8/9 Presbyornis sp. specimen, separate genus-level comparison; not assigned to AMNH28505 or exact P.pervetus model.\", \"model_head_bill_length_m\": 0.1, \"model_head_status\": \"Reconstruction choice near genus evidence; soft tissue and species uncertainty.\"}"
  },
